# Review ownership for madura. The last matching pattern wins, so the catch-all
# comes first and the load-bearing paths below it.
#
# GitHub only requests review from an owner with write access to this
# repository; unknown users or teams are silently ignored, which is why this
# file names people rather than a team that may not exist yet.

* @sgammon

# The distribution contract: what gets built, what ships beside the binary, and
# how it is released. A mistake here is shipped software, not a broken build.
/Makefile           @sgammon
/elide.pkl          @sgammon
/native-image/      @sgammon
/scripts/           @sgammon
/Dockerfile         @sgammon
/.github/           @sgammon

# Licensing and third-party obligations.
/LICENSE            @sgammon
/NOTICE.md          @sgammon
